            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nIn this text, we will go deeper into ideas about evolution and addition that you learned in earlier games (<htcite0>; <htcite1>; <htcite2>). We will also strengthen what you learned in earlier texts about multiplication (<htcite3>; <htcite4>). For that reason, we recommend playing those games and studying those texts before you continue.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "80ae0cca-8a79-4be3-a359-f1dd8700110b",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Hands and music",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
